{"headword":"צָחַק","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. laugh (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ضَحِكَ</span>, <em>laugh</em>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܚܶܟ</span>, cf. Ba<sup>ES 34</sup>; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׂחַק\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׂחַק\", dir=\"rtl\">שׂחק</a><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽחֲקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">Gn 18:13</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצֲחַק־</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:6\" href=\"/Genesis.21.6\">Gn 21:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּצְחָ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:17\" href=\"/Genesis.17.17\">17:17</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּצְחַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">18:12</a>;—<em>laugh</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">Gn 18:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:15\" href=\"/Genesis.18.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:17\" href=\"/Genesis.17.17\">17:17</a> (P); c. ל <em>at, concerning</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:6\" href=\"/Genesis.21.6\">21:6</a>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:25\" href=\"/Judges.16.25\">Ju 16:25</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:6\" href=\"/Exodus.32.6\">Ex 32:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">(בִּי) לְצַ֫חֶק בָּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:14\" href=\"/Genesis.39.14\">Gn 39:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:17\" href=\"/Genesis.39.17\">17</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:14\" href=\"/Genesis.19.14\">Gn 19:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">26:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַחֶ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:9\" href=\"/Genesis.21.9\">21:9</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>jest</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:14\" href=\"/Genesis.19.14\">Gn 19:14</a> (J)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>sport, play</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:9\" href=\"/Genesis.21.9\">Gn 21:9</a> (E); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:6\" href=\"/Exodus.32.6\">Ex 32:6</a> (J); <em>make sport</em> for <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:25\" href=\"/Judges.16.25\">Ju 16:25</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וִישַׂחֶק־לָ֑נוּ</span>); <em>toy with</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶת)</span>, of conjugal caresses <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">Gn 26:8</a> (cf. Doughty<sup>Arab. Des. i. 231</sup>), <em>make a toy of</em>, c. ב, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:14\" href=\"/Genesis.39.14\">39:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:17\" href=\"/Genesis.39.17\">17</a> (all J)."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Pi."}]},"rid":"BDB08351","strong_numbers":["6711"],"next_hw":"צְחֹק","prev_hw":"צַחֲנָה","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["7464"],"TWOT":["1905"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}